From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:29:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] refactor(rfork): harden YuanRong transfer lifecycle

Split RFork configuration, identity, manifest, planner, seed, session, tensor-layout, and transfer responsibilities into focused modules. Manage registered storage, leases, heartbeat, fallback, and shutdown through RForkSession, with core isolated tests and updated planner documentation included in the same change.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
